Asset Attribution
-----------------

3D object models, textures, and robot meshes are NOT redistributed
in this repository. They remain in their respective upstream packages
and are referenced by file path at runtime. The 131 task XML files
contain only scene structure and object placement metadata.

  LIBERO assets    https://github.com/Lifelong-Robot-Learning/LIBERO
                   libero/libero/assets   (MIT)
  robosuite assets https://github.com/ARISE-Initiative/robosuite
                   robosuite/models/assets   (MIT)

scripts/setup_assets.sh fetches LIBERO and links the robosuite assets.
See docs/assets.md for the asset roots and the LIBERO_ASSETS_ROOT /
ROBOSUITE_ASSETS_ROOT overrides.

Demonstration datasets are licensed by LIBERO under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0) and are
downloaded from the LIBERO HuggingFace hub:

  https://huggingface.co/datasets/yifengzhu-hf/LIBERO-datasets

scripts/download_datasets.py fetches them. See docs/datasets.md.

